#: forum/templates/forum/egitim.html:214
msgid "Birebir Online"
msgstr "One-on-One Online"

#: forum/templates/forum/egitim.html:214
msgid "Bireysel, kişiye özel tempo"
msgstr "Individual, personalized pace"

#: forum/templates/forum/egitim.html:215
msgid "Küçük Grup"
msgstr "Small Group"

#: forum/templates/forum/egitim.html:215
msgid "2-5 kişilik akademik/kurumsal gruplar"
msgstr "Academic/corporate groups of 2-5 people"

#: forum/templates/forum/egitim.html:216
msgid "Kurumsal Yerinde"
msgstr "Corporate On-Site"

#: forum/templates/forum/egitim.html:217
msgid "Online + yerinde karışık program"
msgstr "Mixed online + on-site program"

#: forum/templates/forum/egitim.html:221
msgid ""
"Birebir eğitimler 6–8 saatlik paketler hâlinde planlanır; kapsam ön "
"görüşmede netleşir."
msgstr ""
"One-on-one training is planned in 6–8 hour packages; scope is clarified in "
"the pre-call."

#: forum/templates/forum/egitim.html:229
msgid "Eğitmen / Ekip"
msgstr "Instructor / Team"

#: forum/templates/forum/egitim.html:230
msgid "Menüden"
msgstr "From the menu, you can verify by checking"

