"en uygun araç seçilir."
msgstr ""
"We work with a broad toolset including Python (pandas, scikit-learn, "
"TensorFlow), R, SQL, Tableau, Power BI, Excel, and SPSS. The most suitable "
"tool is chosen based on the nature of the project."

