"karşılaştırmalarda Bonferroni düzeltmesi uygulanmıştır."
msgstr ""
"There is a statistically significant difference between the measurements "
"%(col_str)s, F(%(df1)s, %(df2)s) = %(F)s, %(p)s. A Bonferroni correction was"
" applied to the post-hoc comparisons."

